          AI receptionists for real estate range from $59/month for basic plans (Goodcall) to $700+/month for premium human-AI hybrids (Smith.ai). Most agents pay between $150-$400/month. BirkyStudio starts at $250 one-time setup with no monthly fee — you just pay the voice provider directly (~$30-50/mo). Making it one of the most affordable custom solutions.
